sequenceDiagram
  box Aqua Frontend
    participant W as Web
  end
  participant A as API
  W->>A: Request
  par Fetch user
    A->>A: load user
  and Fetch cart
    A->>A: load cart
  end
  critical Charge
    A-xW: declined
  option Retry
    A--)W: retrying
  end
  rect rgb(200,200,255)
    Note right of A: highlighted
  end
  break when closed
    A->>W: bye
  end
